WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.700 --> 00:39.860
=Episode 3=

00:40.020 --> 00:42.620
(Glass Orbs Shock the World)

00:42.980 --> 00:44.140
(Ministry of Works)

00:44.140 --> 00:45.940
Don't worry about this, Mister Wei.

00:46.300 --> 00:47.580
Her Highness

00:47.580 --> 00:48.980
has already instructed me.

00:49.460 --> 00:50.260
But

00:50.460 --> 00:52.420
why are you building such a complex

00:52.700 --> 00:53.500
furnace?

00:55.900 --> 00:57.220
Could it be that Juxian Restaurant

00:57.340 --> 00:59.100
is launching more new dishes?

00:59.660 --> 01:00.860
Come on, Minister Duan.

01:01.140 --> 01:02.340
It's not about food this time.

01:02.820 --> 01:04.020
Just follow this blueprint

01:04.020 --> 01:05.100
and build it for me.

01:05.740 --> 01:06.980
As for the cost,

01:07.700 --> 01:08.460
can you charge me

01:08.460 --> 01:10.340
at the cost price of the materials?

01:10.620 --> 01:11.220
Is...

01:11.460 --> 01:13.500
Isn't this a VIP card
for Juxian Restaurant?

01:14.340 --> 01:16.020
Valid for one year,
no queueing required,

01:16.020 --> 01:17.620
and 20 percent off all dishes.

01:19.280 --> 01:20.860
I'll give you the absolute cost price!

01:24.140 --> 01:24.940
Girl?

01:26.060 --> 01:27.940
Greetings, Your Highness.

01:27.940 --> 01:28.620
Just now,

01:28.620 --> 01:30.220
Wei Hao already spoke with me.

01:31.690 --> 01:32.980
I have urgent business with you.

01:33.900 --> 01:35.940
Then, I shall go find
men to build it right away.

01:40.060 --> 01:41.980
You said those gemstones
were very cheap, right?

01:42.420 --> 01:43.620
I've brought 1,000 guan.

01:44.000 --> 01:45.380
How many of those gemstones do you have?

01:45.580 --> 01:46.300
I want them all.

01:48.020 --> 01:49.700
Who told you I have them right now?

01:50.620 --> 01:51.060
Did...

01:51.300 --> 01:53.220
Didn't you say you
had as many as I wanted?

01:53.740 --> 01:55.380
I still need the machinery to make them.

01:55.520 --> 01:57.900
I just finished discussing
the machinery with Minister Duan.

01:57.900 --> 01:58.940
If you ask for them now,

01:58.940 --> 02:00.410
where am I supposed
to conjure them from?

02:00.420 --> 02:00.860
You...

02:01.580 --> 02:03.060
You big liar!

02:03.660 --> 02:04.700
Regarding Beicang,

02:05.180 --> 02:07.020
I've already boasted to my father.

02:07.660 --> 02:08.620
Don't worry.

02:09.220 --> 02:10.140
Five days.

02:10.320 --> 02:12.380
Give me five days,
and I'll give you a whole cart.

02:16.820 --> 02:17.620
Girl!

02:20.940 --> 02:22.980
Since she's in such a hurry,

02:23.340 --> 02:24.740
I guess I'll work some overtime.

02:25.680 --> 02:27.700
Besides, just running
a restaurant in ancient times

02:28.380 --> 02:29.900
hardly befits a princess.

02:31.460 --> 02:34.020
My real strength is in
math, physics, and chemistry.

02:36.900 --> 02:38.660
(Porcelain Shop)

02:40.460 --> 02:41.700
(Glaze, Ceramics, Pottery Figurines)

02:42.100 --> 02:44.340
Let me see the level of glasswork

02:44.620 --> 02:45.860
in the Great Yong Dynasty.

02:51.700 --> 02:52.540
Ma'am, this is...

02:52.550 --> 02:53.780
I'll sell it to you for 60 guan.

02:53.980 --> 02:54.980
Sixty guan is fine,

02:54.980 --> 02:56.660
but the shop takes a 10 percent cut.

02:56.820 --> 02:57.260
Fine.

02:57.260 --> 02:57.980
Boss,

02:58.220 --> 02:59.180
how much for this?

02:59.880 --> 03:01.460
I was just about to sell it to the shop.

03:01.460 --> 03:02.700
If you want it, it's 60 guan.

03:02.720 --> 03:03.780
Save on the middleman fee.

03:03.940 --> 03:04.740
How much?

03:05.500 --> 03:06.460
Sixty guan.

03:07.300 --> 03:08.100
For this?

03:09.500 --> 03:10.660
It's not worth it.

03:10.860 --> 03:12.100
This is a top-tier glazed cup.

03:12.100 --> 03:13.460
You think 60 guan is expensive?

03:14.100 --> 03:15.780
Have you never seen
anything fine before?

03:16.340 --> 03:18.020
You're saying I lack worldly experience?

03:18.420 --> 03:20.020
This thing is pretty, sure,

03:20.060 --> 03:22.020
but it isn't a rare item.

03:22.500 --> 03:23.660
Not rare?

03:23.940 --> 03:26.140
Try finding a second one
in the whole capital.

03:29.460 --> 03:30.260
Either way,

03:31.020 --> 03:32.420
it's not worth 60 guan.

03:33.340 --> 03:33.980
Pauper.

03:36.900 --> 03:37.980
You mean me?

03:39.660 --> 03:42.020
An ignorant pauper.

03:42.420 --> 03:42.900
You...

03:43.460 --> 03:45.620
You've got a real mouth on you, huh?

03:45.620 --> 03:46.460
What are you doing?

03:46.500 --> 03:47.340
Looking for a fight?

03:47.580 --> 03:48.980
Bring it on. Who's afraid of you?

03:48.980 --> 03:50.060
If you don't dare,

03:50.060 --> 03:50.660
then you're

03:50.900 --> 03:51.660
a turtle.

03:51.900 --> 03:52.980
So foolish?

03:54.580 --> 03:55.540
Alright...

03:55.580 --> 03:56.580
You're more of a fool than I am.

03:57.620 --> 03:58.180
Boss,

03:58.700 --> 03:59.580
how much for this?

04:01.140 --> 04:01.660
Young Master,

04:01.660 --> 04:02.420
60 guan.

04:05.980 --> 04:07.860
(Wei Gaoming,
Crown Prince of Great Yong)

04:07.860 --> 04:08.420
Wrap it up.

04:08.740 --> 04:09.580
Right away.

04:09.660 --> 04:10.540
You

04:10.540 --> 04:11.980
are clearly someone of high status.

04:11.980 --> 04:13.380
Unlike certain paupers.

04:15.060 --> 04:15.700
You...

04:16.140 --> 04:17.060
You actually bought it?

04:19.380 --> 04:20.580
You're a spendthrift, huh?

04:21.740 --> 04:23.500
My friend, you don't know.

04:23.620 --> 04:25.380
This glaze is rare.

04:25.380 --> 04:26.460
With this level of quality,

04:26.460 --> 04:27.970
only one or two pieces are made a year.

04:27.980 --> 04:30.260
Even so, it's not worth 60 guan. This...

04:31.020 --> 04:31.460
You...

04:32.140 --> 04:33.560
You're doing this on purpose,
aren't you?

04:34.260 --> 04:35.380
Here, take it, Young Master.

04:41.900 --> 04:42.900
Thank you, Young Master.

04:42.900 --> 04:44.420
Is this stuff really that easy to sell?

04:44.700 --> 04:45.420
Pauper.

04:50.740 --> 04:52.780
A glass cup of this quality

04:52.780 --> 04:54.540
can actually sell for 60 guan?

04:55.900 --> 04:57.340
If I can produce them too,

04:58.380 --> 04:59.860
won't I make a fortune?

05:03.260 --> 05:05.300
(Wei Mansion)
I heard Wei the Fool's got crazy ideas

05:05.660 --> 05:07.060
about making glaze to earn money.

05:07.220 --> 05:08.740
He seems to have lost his mind.

05:13.460 --> 05:14.700
Back in the day,

05:14.980 --> 05:18.140
when his father was
the richest man in West City,

05:18.260 --> 05:20.980
even he couldn't successfully
set up a glaze workshop.

05:22.100 --> 05:23.820
Now this fool

05:24.180 --> 05:27.260
actually wants to
repeat his father's mistakes.

05:28.180 --> 05:30.100
(Wei Yuanzhao, from a noble clan, Wei Clan Leader)
He’s going to ruin Juxian Restaurant,

05:30.100 --> 05:32.460
which was so difficult to build up.

05:33.700 --> 05:34.700
Everyone knows

05:34.700 --> 05:36.610
that opening a glaze workshop
is a guaranteed loss.

05:36.620 --> 05:38.560
Otherwise, everyone
would have done it long ago.

05:40.460 --> 05:42.540
As for returning to the ancestral home,

05:42.540 --> 05:43.260
I think

05:43.580 --> 05:45.460
they have no chance.

05:49.860 --> 05:51.420
This'll work.

06:01.700 --> 06:02.940
This is interesting.

06:07.660 --> 06:10.020
What's so interesting about rotten sand?

06:10.340 --> 06:12.380
Great Yong is full of idiots.

06:12.820 --> 06:14.580
Who are you?

06:15.820 --> 06:16.940
It's you?

06:17.200 --> 06:18.660
What is a pauper like you doing here?

06:19.260 --> 06:20.500
Me? A pauper?

06:21.060 --> 06:22.140
I, Wei Hao, ever since...

06:22.560 --> 06:24.780
Ever since I was born,
I've hated being called a pauper.

06:25.380 --> 06:26.140
Let me tell you,

06:26.300 --> 06:28.700
today I'll use this sand
to make gemstones.

06:28.700 --> 06:30.500
I'll make it
so your junk won't even sell.

06:32.780 --> 06:34.340
Making gemstones from sand?

06:38.660 --> 06:40.700
Those two newly opened glaze workshops

06:41.100 --> 06:42.690
wouldn't happen to be your doing, right?

06:43.060 --> 06:44.380
Of course, they are.

06:50.700 --> 06:53.300
Gemstones are precious things
born of heaven and earth.

06:53.300 --> 06:54.940
How could they be man-made?

06:55.380 --> 06:56.500
No wonder everyone says

06:56.660 --> 06:58.260
the person who opened that workshop

06:59.100 --> 07:00.700
is a fool.

07:01.140 --> 07:03.900
That's because you don't
understand physics or chemistry.

07:04.220 --> 07:06.100
How hard can it be to fire some glass?

07:06.100 --> 07:07.420
Some people

07:07.700 --> 07:09.780
just love to put on a front.

07:09.820 --> 07:11.900
Actually, it's fine
if you can't afford gemstones.

07:12.100 --> 07:14.420
But you insist on
messing around yourself.

07:14.700 --> 07:16.620
Losing everything you have

07:17.660 --> 07:20.820
will only make you
a bigger laughingstock.

07:22.540 --> 07:23.900
You dare to mock me?

07:23.900 --> 07:24.420
You...

07:25.260 --> 07:26.180
Just you wait.

07:27.660 --> 07:28.460
What?

07:28.800 --> 07:30.940
You're saying Hao is
building a kiln to make glaze?

07:30.940 --> 07:32.220
Yes, Young Madam.

07:32.460 --> 07:34.990
I think the Young Master
is really getting out of hand lately.

07:35.140 --> 07:37.180
He even took 500 guan from the accounts.

07:37.820 --> 07:39.300
That's glaze, you know?

07:39.420 --> 07:41.380
Is that something someone
like he can handle?

07:41.620 --> 07:42.690
The money is a small matter,

07:43.220 --> 07:44.780
but is he crazy?

07:44.790 --> 07:45.780
Messing around like this.

07:46.060 --> 07:46.580
Let's go

07:46.580 --> 07:47.220
have a look.

08:17.020 --> 08:17.820
Hao.

08:20.260 --> 08:21.140
Aunt?

08:22.020 --> 08:23.100
What are you doing here?

08:23.340 --> 08:24.580
You're really making glaze?

08:24.580 --> 08:25.500
Are you crazy?

08:25.510 --> 08:26.580
Do you even know how to do it?

08:26.580 --> 08:27.300
You're just blindly messing around,

08:27.300 --> 08:28.180
wasting money.

08:28.580 --> 08:30.500
Aunt, do you also understand glaze?

08:31.500 --> 08:33.540
I helped your parents with it before.

08:33.550 --> 08:35.500
They couldn't produce
many high-grade pieces in a year.

08:37.620 --> 08:38.300
Fine.

08:38.300 --> 08:39.300
Go inside and get busy.

08:39.300 --> 08:40.760
I'll keep an eye on
things out here for you.

08:43.220 --> 08:44.780
Aunt, you're not here to oppose me?

08:45.220 --> 08:46.740
You've already started,

08:46.740 --> 08:48.460
so I might as well stay and support you.

08:48.820 --> 08:50.940
Then, help me burn some wood ash.

08:51.060 --> 08:52.820
The borax outside is already dry.

08:53.060 --> 08:54.180
If there's any extra...

08:54.180 --> 08:55.020
I know.

08:55.100 --> 08:56.700
I'm not an idiot.

08:58.020 --> 08:58.980
Aunt, you're the best.

08:59.220 --> 09:00.700
I'll go back to building the kiln.

09:03.100 --> 09:03.900
Boss,

09:03.980 --> 09:05.940
the bricks you
invented are really sturdy.

09:06.140 --> 09:06.940
Of course.

09:07.060 --> 09:08.500
How can we fire
the kiln if they aren't sturdy?

09:08.500 --> 09:11.780
Young Madam, weren't you here to
scold the Young Master?

09:12.620 --> 09:14.140
Haven't I already scolded him?

09:16.820 --> 09:19.060
Young Madam, you can't let him
have his way anymore.

09:19.100 --> 09:21.060
You can't let him keep
messing around like this.

09:21.540 --> 09:22.500
That's enough.

09:22.500 --> 09:23.740
It's already quite good.

09:23.860 --> 09:25.740
Hao hasn't been in
a fight for a long time.

09:31.420 --> 09:32.300
Where is Ning'an?

09:32.380 --> 09:34.140
Why haven't I seen her?

09:34.300 --> 09:35.500
She just left the palace.

09:35.500 --> 09:36.540
Lately,

09:36.540 --> 09:39.060
the royal businesses have all
been handed over to her to manage.

09:39.400 --> 09:40.420
It couldn't be helped.

09:41.000 --> 09:42.720
Since the Crown Prince
wants to follow you,

09:43.260 --> 09:45.260
I could only let Ning'an go instead.

09:45.260 --> 09:47.380
How much money is left
in the imperial treasury?

09:50.060 --> 09:51.420
It ran out last month.

09:51.940 --> 09:52.460
What?

09:57.060 --> 09:58.500
Out of money since last month?

09:59.060 --> 09:59.620
Your Majesty,

10:00.500 --> 10:02.060
these things shouldn't be your concern.

10:03.180 --> 10:03.780
This won't do.

10:04.940 --> 10:06.140
When Ning'an returns,

10:06.140 --> 10:07.460
have her come to Ganlu Palace.

10:08.060 --> 10:09.100
I want to hear her

10:09.100 --> 10:10.540
explain the current situation.

10:10.940 --> 10:13.980
The court is also
short on money this year.

10:14.820 --> 10:16.400
The deficit at the Ministry of Revenue

10:16.500 --> 10:17.860
has reached 300,000 guan.

10:19.260 --> 10:21.940
I still don't know
where to make up for it.

10:31.820 --> 10:33.060
Whether we succeed today

10:33.660 --> 10:35.020
depends on this kiln.

10:35.300 --> 10:36.580
If it doesn't fire correctly,

10:36.740 --> 10:37.900
we will lose money.

10:38.780 --> 10:39.740
Everyone outside

10:39.740 --> 10:41.180
knows the kiln opens today.

10:41.220 --> 10:42.300
They're all waiting there,

10:42.300 --> 10:44.020
basically just to see
the Young Master make a fool of himself.

10:44.980 --> 10:46.580
That silly girl.

10:46.580 --> 10:47.540
She's still not here.

10:47.600 --> 10:48.700
The first kiln is about to open,

10:48.700 --> 10:50.100
and she doesn't even come to witness it.

10:50.100 --> 10:54.660
(Ganlu Palace)

10:55.860 --> 10:56.620
Your Highness.

10:56.740 --> 10:58.300
How much longer will my father be?

10:58.540 --> 11:00.700
(Eunuch Wang, Chief Eunuch of the Imperial Court)
His Majesty is discussing military matters.

11:00.700 --> 11:02.220
Perhaps you could wait a bit longer?

11:03.620 --> 11:04.900
(Father is really something.)

11:05.140 --> 11:06.680
(He asked me to report
on the imperial treasury,)

11:06.700 --> 11:07.820
(then forgot all about it.)

11:14.180 --> 11:15.860
It's the fifth day today.

11:16.340 --> 11:17.460
I wonder if Wei the Fool

11:17.460 --> 11:18.620
finished it or not.

11:19.380 --> 11:20.140
Hao,

11:20.140 --> 11:21.220
who are you waiting for?

11:21.460 --> 11:22.220
The Princess.

11:22.500 --> 11:24.500
She doesn't even show up
for her own workshop's opening.

11:24.700 --> 11:25.700
She's quite carefree.

11:27.300 --> 11:27.740
Princess...

11:28.140 --> 11:28.660
This...

11:29.260 --> 11:31.900
This workshop belongs to Her Highness?

11:33.420 --> 11:34.460
She's my partner.

11:34.460 --> 11:35.210
It's fifty-fifty.

11:35.660 --> 11:36.460
Then,

11:36.660 --> 11:37.820
does she know...

11:37.820 --> 11:38.780
Does she know what?

11:39.020 --> 11:40.180
She doesn't know anything.

11:40.460 --> 11:41.020
Forget it.

11:42.800 --> 11:43.420
It's about time.

11:43.420 --> 11:43.980
Open the kiln.

11:44.380 --> 11:45.260
Right away, Boss.

11:45.400 --> 11:46.580
The temperature inside is high.

11:46.580 --> 11:47.220
Be careful.

11:47.340 --> 11:48.260
We will, Boss.

11:55.740 --> 11:56.300
Careful.

11:56.740 --> 11:57.540
Stand back.

11:57.540 --> 11:58.490
Let the heat dissipate.

12:01.700 --> 12:02.460
That should do it.

12:03.500 --> 12:04.380
Alright, everyone,

12:04.380 --> 12:05.420
be careful now.

12:06.500 --> 12:06.900
Move.

12:07.140 --> 12:08.960
(So this is a workshop
the Princess has a stake in.)

12:09.300 --> 12:10.620
(If it fails to produce anything,)

12:10.620 --> 12:11.260
(then)

12:11.740 --> 12:13.060
(heads will roll.)

12:13.620 --> 12:14.540
(Hao must be)

12:14.900 --> 12:16.380
(under immense pressure.)

12:16.860 --> 12:17.660
Hao,

12:17.980 --> 12:18.860
don't worry.

12:19.100 --> 12:20.460
You will succeed.

12:20.460 --> 12:21.540
I saw it earlier.

12:21.540 --> 12:23.940
What you and
your parents made is different.

12:24.100 --> 12:25.380
Aunt, why are you pinching me?

12:26.140 --> 12:28.190
Look how nervous you
are over such a small thing.

12:28.340 --> 12:29.020
Who...

12:29.140 --> 12:30.220
Who's nervous?

12:31.000 --> 12:32.380
If you're not nervous, why pinch me?

12:32.700 --> 12:33.980
It hurts if I pinch myself.

12:34.000 --> 12:35.480
But it doesn't hurt me if you pinch me?

12:36.500 --> 12:37.460
Seriously.

12:38.140 --> 12:38.700
Boss.

12:38.700 --> 12:39.620
Boss, we did it.

12:39.620 --> 12:40.380
We did it!

12:40.580 --> 12:41.380
Quickly.

12:42.060 --> 12:43.100
Bring one out to show me.

12:43.340 --> 12:44.180
Yes.

12:46.900 --> 12:47.780
Oh my, Boss.

12:48.020 --> 12:48.460
What...

12:48.460 --> 12:49.340
What is this?

12:49.340 --> 12:50.660
I've never seen anything like it.

12:50.900 --> 12:52.020
Is it a gemstone?

12:52.260 --> 12:53.180
It's so beautiful.

12:53.820 --> 12:55.500
It must be worth a fortune.

13:03.180 --> 13:04.540
Is this a gemstone?

13:13.180 --> 13:16.020
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

13:16.620 --> 13:20.020
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

13:20.780 --> 13:23.740
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

13:24.100 --> 13:26.780
♪Sigh and walk away♪

13:28.380 --> 13:31.860
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

13:31.860 --> 13:34.100
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

13:34.100 --> 13:36.180
♪Colors and darkness♪

13:36.180 --> 13:38.220
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

13:38.220 --> 13:42.580
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

13:44.020 --> 13:47.740
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

13:48.020 --> 13:51.620
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

13:51.780 --> 13:53.860
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

13:53.860 --> 13:58.660
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

13:58.860 --> 14:00.500
♪The world mistakes me♪

14:00.500 --> 14:02.820
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

14:02.900 --> 14:04.100
♪As the storm approaches♪

14:04.100 --> 14:06.500
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

14:06.700 --> 14:08.420
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

14:08.420 --> 14:10.380
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

14:10.580 --> 14:12.300
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

14:12.300 --> 14:14.420
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

14:14.420 --> 14:15.900
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

14:15.900 --> 14:18.100
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

14:18.340 --> 14:19.540
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

14:19.540 --> 14:22.060
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

14:22.180 --> 14:23.900
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

14:23.900 --> 14:25.180
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

14:25.340 --> 14:26.740
♪My wish has finally come true♪

14:26.740 --> 14:27.780
♪To stay by your side♪

14:27.780 --> 14:29.700
♪In this fleeting world♪

14:29.860 --> 14:33.140
♪We are free and happy♪

14:37.140 --> 14:38.900
♪From a nobody♪

14:38.900 --> 14:40.820
♪To someone now famous♪

14:40.900 --> 14:42.340
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

14:42.340 --> 14:44.860
♪But I laugh at how they
cannot see through it all♪

14:44.940 --> 14:46.540
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

14:46.540 --> 14:48.620
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

14:48.820 --> 14:50.500
♪In this vast world♪

14:50.500 --> 14:52.500
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

14:52.660 --> 14:54.860
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

14:54.860 --> 14:56.460
♪Everything ends eventually♪

14:56.540 --> 14:58.020
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

14:58.020 --> 15:00.420
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

15:00.420 --> 15:02.140
♪No matter how time flies♪

15:02.140 --> 15:03.300
♪Even if the falling snow♪

15:03.300 --> 15:04.940
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

15:04.940 --> 15:05.980
♪All I want now♪

15:05.980 --> 15:08.060
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

15:08.060 --> 15:11.340
♪Year after year♪
